# ---- Large binaries live in deliverables/ with SHA-256 records ----
# (see docs/deliverables.md). The report PDF/DOCX stay in git: they are graded
# deliverables and small. The APK and the demo video do not.
demo/*.mp4
demo/*.webm
*.apk
deliverables/*.apk
deliverables/*.mp4

# ---- Python (token tooling) ----
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# ---- Course material kept locally, not part of this project ----
# The assignment deck stays on the author's machine; it is not distributed with the app.
/实验-2.pptx
